### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### 1) Create Prequalification Template
POST http://localhost:3000/template/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": "project-1001",
  "projectType": "high-rise residential",
  "requirements": {
    "region": "Middle East",
    "contractType": "design-build"
  }
}

### 2) Create Scoring Matrix (replace templateId)
POST http://localhost:3000/scoring/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": "project-1001",
  "templateId": "replace-template-id",
  "globalThresholdPercent": 60,
  "criteria": [
    {
      "key": "experience_years",
      "label": "Relevant Experience",
      "category": "qualitative",
      "weight": 40,
      "method": "scaled",
      "maxScore": 5,
      "threshold": 3,
      "mandatory": true
    },
    {
      "key": "annual_turnover",
      "label": "Annual Turnover",
      "category": "quantitative",
      "weight": 60,
      "method": "scaled",
      "maxScore": 5,
      "threshold": 2,
      "mandatory": true
    }
  ]
}

### 3) Upload and Parse BOQ (multipart, file required)
# Example curl:
# curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/boq/upload \
#   -F "projectId=project-1001" \
#   -F "file=@samples/vendor_documents/vendor_a_profile.txt"

### 4) Analyze Vendor Submission (multipart, documents required)
# Example curl:
# curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/vendor/analyze \
#   -F "projectId=project-1001" \
#   -F "vendorId=vendor-a" \
#   -F "templateId=replace-template-id" \
#   -F "structuredInput={\"vendorTier\":\"A\"}" \
#   -F "documents=@samples/vendor_documents/vendor_a_profile.txt"

### 5) Score Vendor (replace scoringMatrixId + vendorEvaluationId)
POST http://localhost:3000/vendor/score
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": "project-1001",
  "vendorId": "vendor-a",
  "scoringMatrixId": "replace-scoring-matrix-id",
  "vendorEvaluationId": "replace-vendor-evaluation-id"
}

### 6) Compare Vendors (replace score ids)
POST http://localhost:3000/vendor/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": "project-1001",
  "vendorScoreIds": ["replace-score-id-a", "replace-score-id-b"]
}

### 7) Generate report
GET http://localhost:3000/report/project-1001
